      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "有多少人戴眼镜了",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "以前小学时，我们没有人戴眼镜，虽然后面都近视了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "为什么？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我不知道啊！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "可能有些近视了。像我都有点近视了，到了初二我才配的眼镜。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "像你们现在，6个人有3个人近视戴眼镜了，还有一些是近视了没戴眼镜的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "所以说你们班里面有多少人戴眼镜的，你数过没有？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "没数。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "track_id": "es-ES-elevenlabs",
