      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "Combien d'enfants portent des lunettes maintenant ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_title_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:52:36+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Quand j'étais à l'école primaire, aucun de nous ne portait de lunettes, même si nous sommes tous devenus myopes plus tard.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_001_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:52:39+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Pourquoi ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_002_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:52:40+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Je ne sais pas !",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_003_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:52:41+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Certains d'entre nous étaient peut-être déjà myopes. Moi, j'étais déjà un peu myope, mais je n'ai eu des lunettes qu'en deuxième année de collège.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_004_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:52:45+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Regarde les enfants aujourd'hui. Sur ces six, trois sont myopes et portent des lunettes. Et certains sont myopes sans porter de lunettes.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_005_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:52:48+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Alors, combien d'enfants portent des lunettes dans ta classe ? Tu les as comptés ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_006_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:52:51+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Je n'ai pas compté.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-09-15-how-many-kids-wear-glasses-now_dialogue_007_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:52:52+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
